{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35617","headline":"寒食二首 二 · 李山甫","name":"寒食二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风烟放荡花披猖，秋千女儿飞短墙。\n绣袍驰马拾遗翠，锦袖鬬鸡喧广塲。\n天地气和融霁色，池台日暖烧春光。\n自怜尘土无他事，空脱荷衣泥醉乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}